nicipality_code":"23102","municipality_pref":"愛知県","municipality_name":"名古屋市東区","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[136.93452414,35.17825517]}}],"display_comment_original":"名古屋市東区には、地域の由緒を示す案内板や石碑を探す余地がある。 この地域には寺社や信仰の場、史跡や遺跡、古墳や貝塚に関わる場所が見え、配当所跡、水野太郎左衛門宅跡、井上士朗宅跡のような地点が探索の入口になる。 現地では史跡説明板が手がかりになりそうだ。さらに水辺の暮らしや堤防整備の歴史を示す案内板に加え、治水碑や河川改修の記念碑が狙い目になる。","story_enrichment":{"samurai_priority_people":[],"notable_people":["海部俊樹","盛田昭夫","赤尾敏"],"honorary_citizens":[],"tourism_landmarks":["含笑寺","建中寺","照遠寺","眞柳寺","長久寺","長母寺","徳源寺","本住寺"],"specialties":[],"food_culture":[],"historical_domains":[],"heian_place_names":[],"japan_search_support":[],"enrichment_sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%9D%B1%E5%8C%BA_%28%E5%90%8D%E5%8F%A4%E5%B1%8B%E5%B8%82%29","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q315579","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q310845","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q1063211","https://jpsearch.go.jp/csearch/jps-cross?csid=jps-cross&keyword=%E6%B5%B7%E9%83%A8%E4%BF%8A%E6%A8%B9&keyword=%E5%90%8D%E5%8F%A4%E5%B1%8B%E5%B8%82%E6%9D%B1%E5%8C%BA"],"enrichment_errors":[],"wikipedia_title":"東区 (名古屋市)","wikipedia_revision_id":"110688127","wikidata_qid":"Q578824","wikipedia_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%9D%B1%E5%8C%BA_%28%E5%90%8D%E5%8F%A4%E5%B1%8B%E5%B8%82%29","japan_search_query_url":"https://jpsearch.go.jp/csearch/jps-cross?csid=jps-cross&keyword=%E6%B5%B7%E9%83%A8%E4%BF%8A%E6%A8%B9&keyword=%E5%90%8D%E5%8F%A4%E5%B1%8B%E5%B8%82%E6%9D%B1%E5%8C%BA","status":"wikipedia_ok"}}